Since people are on the idea of adding monsters to Nethack..how about
a scroll of summon monster where the monster summoned is your pet for
your length of stay on that level.

In other words while on a certain level the monster is tame towards
the player and will do as the player commands (as long as it's not to
committ suicide or somesuch) as long as the player is on the same
level.

Then after a certain number of turns while the player is off level the
summoned monster will become wild and could attack the player.

Associated with this the player would have a better chance of use a
Tame monster spell on such a monster when returning to the level. 

Also...the player could not summon another Human type character or any
of the quest nemsis/demons (ie: Jubilex).

What do ya thing....

